(text "the simulator can get ready before enabling your state machine." (rect 344 264 720 278)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "This is your state machine.  It receives sensor signals from the system" (rect 344 216 752 230)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "simulator and uses that information to control the conveyors, and" (rect 344 232 726 246)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "wrapper.  It also receives a clock and reset from the simulator so that" (rect 344 248 749 262)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "This is the simulator.  It pretends to be the palletizer system and acts according to what your state machine" (rect 848 216 1479 230)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "tells it to do with the conveyors etc." (rect 848 232 1055 246)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
(text "Mux to switch between manual control and your controller." (rect 336 640 677 654)(font "Intel Clear" (font_size 8)))
